\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>+1 Charisma is given.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041850\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 572/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5986/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1012/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 923172/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.725      1 -total\n 52.43%   25.545      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 51.41%   25.049      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 49.61%   24.171      1 Template:Ambox\n 47.50%   23.143      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 16.63%    8.103      1 Template:Uid\n 10.01%    4.876      1 Template:Template_style\n  7.38%    3.594      1 Template:PageSeo\n  7.25%    3.532      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  6.80%    3.313      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:56616-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715041850 and revision id 366810. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}